            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "content": "I also closely worked closely with UI designers to implement two distinct UI for the game.<br><br>In implementing Decor Palette, I expanded on Common UI inherited classes to create custom grid button arrays. This class was designed so that it builds from column to rows ,which was a specifically requested design spec. I also implementing combo filter systems, creating new structs to handle data management efficiently. <br><br>For the building info panel, I learned to use animation Unreal's UMG. This was genuinely one of the most fun and rewarding task. Animating each tabs to the vision of the UI designer was truly fullfilling.",
            "variant": "body",
            "align": "left",
            "color": "foreground",
            "transform": "none"
          },
          "id": "blk_4dc94125",
          "layout": {
